{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.44, "text": " Deux heures, c'est ce que ton matin te coûte chaque jour.", "words": [{"word": " Deux", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.12}, {"word": " heures,", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.28}, {"word": " c", "start": 0.32, "end": 0.5}, {"word": "'est", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.62}, {"word": " ce", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.72}, {"word": " que", "start": 0.72, "end": 0.92}, {"word": " ton", "start": 0.92, "end": 1.06}, {"word": " matin", "start": 1.06, "end": 1.32}, {"word": " te", "start": 1.32, "end": 1.5}, {"word": " coûte", "start": 1.5, "end": 1.86}, {"word": " chaque", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.14}, {"word": " jour.", "start": 2.14, "end": 2.44}]}, {"start": 3.1, "end": 4.66, "text": " Trois habitudes pour les récupérer.", "words": [{"word": " Trois", "start": 3.1, "end": 3.5}, {"word": " habitudes", "start": 3.5, "end": 3.78}, {"word": " pour", "start": 3.78, "end": 3.9}, {"word": " les", "start": 3.9, "end": 3.98}, {"word": " récupérer.", "start": 3.98, "end": 4.66}]}, {"start": 4.86, "end": 10.52, "text": " 1. Pas de téléphone la première heure, parce que juste deux minutes sur une appli, ça finit souvent en une demi-heure.", "words": [{"word": " 1.", "start": 4.86, "end": 5.08}, {"word": " Pas", "start": 5.26, "end": 5.66}, {"word": " de", "start": 5.66, "end": 5.76}, {"word": " téléphone", "start": 5.76, "end": 6.08}, {"word": " la", "start": 6.08, "end": 6.34}, {"word": " première", "start": 6.34, "end": 6.58}, {"word": " heure,", "start": 6.58, "end": 6.88}, {"word": " parce", "start": 6.98, "end": 7.32}, {"word": " que", "start": 7.32, "end": 7.46}, {"word": " juste", "start": 7.46, "end": 7.68}, {"word": " deux", "start": 7.68, "end": 8.0}, {"word": " minutes", "start": 8.0, "end": 8.24}, {"word": " sur", "start": 8.24, "end": 8.64}, {"word": " une", "start": 8.64, "end": 8.78}, {"word": " appli,", "start": 8.78, "end": 8.98}, {"word": " ça", "start": 9.12, "end": 9.26}, {"word": " finit", "start": 9.26, "end": 9.54}, {"word": " souvent", "start": 9.54, "end": 9.78}, {"word": " en", "start": 9.78, "end": 9.96}, {"word": " une", "start": 9.96, "end": 10.12}, {"word": " demi", "start": 10.12, "end": 10.34}, {"word": "-heure.", "start": 10.34, "end": 10.52}]}, {"start": 11.239999999999998, "end": 15.94, "text": " 2. Tu choisis ta tâche la plus importante la veille, comme ça au réveil, tu attaques direct.", "words": [{"word": " 2.", "start": 11.239999999999998, "end": 11.64}, {"word": " Tu", "start": 11.92, "end": 12.32}, {"word": " choisis", "start": 12.32, "end": 12.62}, {"word": " ta", "start": 12.62, "end": 12.76}, {"word": " tâche", "start": 12.76, "end": 12.98}, {"word": " la", "start": 12.98, "end": 13.12}, {"word": " plus", "start": 13.12, "end": 13.3}, {"word": " importante", "start": 13.3, "end": 13.7}, {"word": " la", "start": 13.7, "end": 14.02}, {"word": " veille,", "start": 14.02, "end": 14.32}, {"word": " comme", "start": 14.34, "end": 14.8}, {"word": " ça", "start": 14.8, "end": 14.94}, {"word": " au", "start": 14.94, "end": 15.06}, {"word": " réveil,", "start": 15.06, "end": 15.36}, {"word": " tu", "start": 15.36, "end": 15.46}, {"word": " attaques", "start": 15.46, "end": 15.7}, {"word": " direct.", "start": 15.7, "end": 15.94}]}, {"start": 16.919999999999998, "end": 23.36, "text": " 3. Tes mails et tes messages, c'est à heure fixe, pas au réveil, sinon tu gères les urgences des autres.", "words": [{"word": " 3.", "start": 16.919999999999998, "end": 17.32}, {"word": " Tes", "start": 17.74, "end": 18.14}, {"word": " mails", "start": 18.14, "end": 18.44}, {"word": " et", "start": 18.44, "end": 18.54}, {"word": " tes", "start": 18.54, "end": 18.66}, {"word": " messages,", "start": 18.66, "end": 19.04}, {"word": " c", "start": 19.24, "end": 19.62}, {"word": "'est", "start": 19.62, "end": 19.74}, {"word": " à", "start": 19.74, "end": 19.82}, {"word": " heure", "start": 19.82, "end": 20.0}, {"word": " fixe,", "start": 20.0, "end": 20.5}, {"word": " pas", "start": 20.5, "end": 20.84}, {"word": " au", "start": 20.84, "end": 21.0}, {"word": " réveil,", "start": 21.0, "end": 21.44}, {"word": " sinon", "start": 21.46, "end": 21.88}, {"word": " tu", "start": 21.88, "end": 22.06}, {"word": " gères", "start": 22.06, "end": 22.3}, {"word": " les", "start": 22.3, "end": 22.44}, {"word": " urgences", "start": 22.44, "end": 23.02}, {"word": " des", "start": 23.02, "end": 23.12}, {"word": " autres.", "start": 23.12, "end": 23.36}]}, {"start": 24.499999999999996, "end": 27.2, "text": " Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour.", "words": [{"word": " Franchement,", "start": 24.499999999999996, "end": 24.9}, {"word": " mise", "start": 24.96, "end": 25.36}, {"word": " bout", "start": 25.36, "end": 25.5}, {"word": " à", "start": 25.5, "end": 25.62}, {"word": " bout,", "start": 25.62, "end": 25.74}, {"word": " ça", "start": 25.82, "end": 26.06}, {"word": " peut", "start": 26.06, "end": 26.22}, {"word": " te", "start": 26.22, "end": 26.3}, {"word": " rendre", "start": 26.3, "end": 26.46}, {"word": " deux", "start": 26.46, "end": 26.68}, {"word": " heures", "start": 26.68, "end": 26.84}, {"word": " par", "start": 26.84, "end": 26.98}, {"word": " jour.", "start": 26.98, "end": 27.2}]}], "text": " Deux heures, c'est ce que ton matin te coûte chaque jour.  Trois habitudes pour les récupérer.  1. Pas de téléphone la première heure, parce que juste deux minutes sur une appli, ça finit souvent en une demi-heure.  2. Tu choisis ta tâche la plus importante la veille, comme ça au réveil, tu attaques direct.  3. Tes mails et tes messages, c'est à heure fixe, pas au réveil, sinon tu gères les urgences des autres.  Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour."}